[{"id":4965937685,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ_4yFQ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"ccbfd4650ba063ca965542993ef0389d304b575e","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"Looks good to me.\r\n\r\nDepending on whether we provide visionOS Mono builds, there may be a case where the download link is broken in the Mono editor.\r\n\r\nBut this is already the case for the Web platform, which we don't seem to special case (this is with a `GODOT_VERSION_STATUS=dev3 scons module_mono_enabled=yes` build):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"782\" height=\"149\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65621b52-3522-46ea-a2ca-7e9b11d0c82a\" />\r\n\r\nBut let's see if C# works on visionOS like it does on iOS, then we can provide the templates for the Mono flavor too.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122559#pullrequestreview-4965937685","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122559","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-18T21:29:45Z"},{"id":4968594476,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKCa8LA","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"ccbfd4650ba063ca965542993ef0389d304b575e","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"Code looks good.\n\nWe can wrap it and `web` template part in `#ifdef`, doing it for platform line only should be enough.\n\n```c++\n#include \"modules/modules_enabled.gen.h\"\n\n...\n...\n\n#ifndef MODULE_MONO_ENABLED\n\t\tinfo.templates = { TemplateID::WEB, TemplateID::WEB_EXTENSIONS, TemplateID::WEB_NOTHREADS, TemplateID::WEB_EXTENSIONS_NOTHREADS };\n#endif\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122559#pullrequestreview-4968594476","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122559","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-19T05:07:57Z"},{"id":4989800234,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKWpPKg","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"5f51673ea438254daa270c5dc72b857d43b58ef0","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122559#pullrequestreview-4989800234","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122559","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-08-21T04:59:18Z"}]